  "commit_message": "Split third-party notices out of LICENSE so GitHub detects MIT (#3317)\n\n* Split third-party notices out of LICENSE so GitHub detects MIT\n\nThe LICENSE file carried ~1.1KB of third-party notes after the MIT text,\nwhich drops it below licensee's similarity threshold; GitHub reports the\nrepo license as \"Other\" (SPDX NOASSERTION). Keep LICENSE as the bare MIT\ntext and move the notes, verbatim, to THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.\n\n* Correct the third-party notices\n\n- Redis: BSD-3 only through 7.2; RSALv2/SSPLv",
